What is the number of centimeters in the length of $EF$ if $AB\parallel CD\parallel EF$?

[asy]

size(4cm,4cm);
pair A,B,C,D,E,F,X;

A=(0,1);
B=(1,1);
C=(1,0);
X=(0,0);
D=(1/3)*C+(2/3)*X;

draw (A--B--C--D);
draw(D--B);
draw(A--C);

